// Fixture (expected-NOT-noop, safe/conservative case): inherits a
// stateful mixin THEN the target, so the target's variables start at a
// nonzero offset. create() redundantly targets it. Must NOT be a no-op:
// applying the swap for real would discard the mixin's svar.
inherit "/clone/replace_program/replace_vo_statemixin";
inherit "/clone/replace_program/replace_min_target";
void create() { replace_program("/clone/replace_program/replace_min_target"); }
